.SS "delegate void SystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.PriorityQueueAction< T, TCompare > (ref T[] container, TCompare comparer)"

.PP
Represents a delegate that performs a sorting or rearrangement operation on a priority‑queue container\&. 
.br
 The action receives the underlying array by reference and a comparison strategy used to determine the ordering of elements\&. 
.PP
